  "p.h5":"This website","p.p5":"Browsing the site needs no account and uses no tracking cookies. It only remembers the theme and language you choose, in your own browser. The shop and profile use Discord login (we only ask for your name, avatar and ID, never your email or messages) and a cookie used only to keep you logged in. We store your Discord ID, name, avatar, credit, top-up and purchase history, and your keys, to run the shop.",
  "p.h6":"Contact","p.p6":"For questions or to request deletion, reach us on Discord.",
